Package: ccu-jack
Version: {PKG_VERSION}
Architecture: {PKG_ARCH}
Maintainer: CCU-Jack <info@ccu-historian.de>
Depends: debmatic
Section: misc
Priority: extra
Homepage: https://github.com/mdzio/ccu-jack
Description: REST/MQTT interface for the Homematic CCU
 CCU-Jack provides simple and secure REST and MQTT based access to the
 data points of a Homematic CCU. This package integrates CCU-Jack as an
 add-on into a Debmatic installation.
